        '0.5': 'Wise one, tell us what we should say there when we go, and what should be kept back."',
        '0.6': 'So bidden by him, Hanuman, his hair bristling with joy, bowed his head to Queen Sita and replied:',
        '0.7': '"Before your very eyes I leapt into the sky from the top of Mahendra, intent on reaching the southern shore of the ocean.',
