        '0.51': 'There I roamed the whole night searching for the daughter of Janaka; I went into Ravana\'s inner apartments, but did not find the slender-waisted one.',
        '0.52': 'Not finding Sita in Ravana\'s palace, I fell into an ocean of grief and could see no shore to it.',
        '0.53': 'As I grieved, I saw a splendid palace garden enclosed by a high golden wall.',
