        '0.92': 'I reflected for a while, but my mind found no peace. I thought out a way to speak with Janaki:',
        '0.93': 'I began by praising the line of the Ikshvaku race. Hearing my words, adorned with the names of royal sages,',
        '0.94': 'the queen, her eyes veiled with tears, answered me: "Who are you? Who sent you, and how did you come here, best of monkeys?',
        '0.95': 'And what is your friendship with Rama? Please tell me that." Hearing her words, I in turn replied:',
        '0.96': '"Queen, your husband Rama has an ally of terrible valour, the mighty and heroic Sugriva, king of the monkeys.',
        '0.97': 'Know me to be his servant, Hanuman, who has come here, sent to you by your husband Rama of tireless deeds.',
